###############################################################################
# VM INTEGRATION PACKAGES (15)
#
# Purpose:
#   Minimal packages required for proper guest ↔ host integration when
#   running inside a virtual machine.
#
# What belongs here:
#   - QEMU / libvirt guest agents
#   - SPICE integration tools (clipboard, resize, input sync)
#   - Packages that only make sense inside a VM
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#   - Desktop environments or window managers
#   - Wayland / X11 stacks
#   - General user applications
#   - Packages that are also required on bare metal
#
###############################################################################


qemu-guest-agent
spice-vdagent